# Destructive action rules

- Never delete on hit.
- Never let Game C delete anything.
- Never enable live deletion without OAuth, server-owned queues, queue hashing, review verification, rate-limit handling, and audit logging.
- Keep tokens server-side only.
- Do not log access tokens, refresh tokens, or full tweet text by default.
- Live delete must be feature flagged and disabled by default.
